1 DOCUMENT 
2 TITL JL TANCERMAN - Lopata family tree 
2 DESCRIPTION This is the LOPATA portion of my family tree. It was initially compile
3 CONC d on paper in 1961 with my grandfather Albert (Abraham) LOPATA, and I'
3 CONC ve erratically maintained it through the past 45 years or so, with the
3 CONC  help of cousins over 3 continents. It is however incomplete, as the f
3 CONC amily has branched out exponentially through 4 or even 5 generations s
3 CONC ince then, and I would deeply appreciate all relevant input regarding 
3 CONC family members past and present: names, dates of birth, etc. Hope you 
3 CONC enjoy this genealogy in its present state. 
3 CONT 
3 CONT Note: click the Menu symbol at top left (3 horizontal bars) and choose
3 CONC  the genealogy "view" you want : the graphical TREE view is best suite
3 CONC d with a computer or tablet, other views are ok with a phone. You can 
3 CONC zoom, pan, drag the graphical tree for exploring, and click all items 
3 CONC (names, links) for more details. Enjoy ! 
3 CONT 
3 CONT Your comments are welcome, as always.
3 CONT Jean-Louis Tancerman
3 CONT jltancerman@outlook.fr 
3 CONT 
